Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

I am specifying a latent longitudinal growth curve model in R with
multiple time-invariant covariates. However, my outcome is binary (0/1).
 I read through the growth() function documentation <https://rdrr.io/cran/lavaan/man/growth.html>,
 but didn't find anything specific to my situation. I know it's
statistically possible, but was wondering if anything needs to be done
with syntax to account for the outcome.

Thank you!

